      Thus our ancient instincts tell our modem minds that the world is
out of balance. Science, which took us away from the sky and its
philosophies of centeredness, now embraces the Big Bang theory, in
which all things start from a common source or center, time and space

not existing until that hypothetical explosion.— Science has come full
circle.      Once   pulling   us   away       from   the   concept   of   a    cycle   and
