TRUE HELIACAL RISING-THE END OF INVISIBILITY

        Another twenty-five days pass and now the Sun is at 9° Leo, now
   rising with Sirius. This is called true heliacal rising, rising with the sun,
   and marks the mathematical end to the period of arising and lying
   hidden.
