   rose with 7° Aries, therefore Scheat was 8° in front of the rising Sun and
   would be a bright star rising just before the dawn light spread through
   the sky.
        For Taurus, Gemini, and Cancer there are two graphs for each sign
   as there are so many bright stars that co-rise in these signs. Use both
   graphs and select the star that best fits in terms of its degrees in front of
